<p>You extend slimy roots into the ground, follow them, and re-appear somewhere else in a range of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> with error margin of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 2, 2, 1.</acronym></p><p>Doing so changes your internal structure slightly, taking <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> random talent(s) off cooldown.</p>